    "reason": "INDEPENDENT SEMANTIC PASS / KEEP exact inner profile. The coupled donor/acceptor expectation matches the operative goal description independently reviewed in D-B and the official HE E.1/BY9.6 competence core. Zn/Cu and Fe/Cu equations conserve atoms/charge and require two-electron transfer; the reducing agent itself is oxidized. The second case changes the metal and adds an independently judged false role claim, without requiring recall or full equation balancing. Supplied equations remain task material and neither the image nor the answer key counts as learner evidence. DE/EN cover the same assignments and coupling. The minimum two demonstrations can be within one substantial multipart transfer task; no extra task quota is inferred. AI candidate only, needs_human_review, E1/G1; no observed learner mastery or human approval.",
